# Tranquil Frillback paid once: Bot1 floats {G}{G}{G} from Black Lotus and pays {G} one time, so {G}{G} stays in the pool. The
# reflexive ability may then choose one mode at most (CR 603.12a: "up to that many"): two modes are refused, and Bot1 gains 4
# life with the third alone. Bot2's Sol Ring, which a second mode would have destroyed, stays.

